   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C10-042",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "家下媳妇们捧过大迎枕来，拉着袖口露出脉来。先生伸手按在右手脉上，宁神细诊了有半刻的工夫，方换过左手，亦复如是。",
  "title": "凝神细诊",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "move",
    "actor": "zhang_youshi",
    "via": [
     "bedchamber",
     "screen_bed"
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c10-diagnose",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 10,
   "paragraphLead": "且说次日午间，人回道",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C10-043",
  "speaker": "zhang_youshi",
  "text": "先生道：“看得尊夫人这脉息：左寸沉数，左关沉伏，右寸细而无力，右关需而无神。或以这个脉为喜脉，则小弟不敢从其教也。”",
  "title": "断脉非喜",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "zhang_youshi",
    "kind": "idle",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c10-diagnose",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 10,
   "paragraphLead": "且说次日午间，人回道",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C10-044",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "旁边贴身伏侍的婆子道：“真正先生说的如神，倒不用我们告诉了。”",
  "title": "婆子称如神",
  "actions": [],
  "offscreen": true
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c10-diagnose",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 10,
   "paragraphLead": "且说次日午间，人回道",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C10-045",
  "speaker": "zhang_youshi",
  "text": "先生道：“大奶奶是个心性高强、聪明不过的人。聪明忒过，则不如意事常有；不如意事常有，则思虑太过。此病是忧虑伤脾，肝木忒旺，经血所以不能按时而至。”",
  "title": "论病源",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "zhang_youshi",
    "kind": "greet",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c10-diagnose",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 10,
   "paragraphLead": "且说次日午间，人回道",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C10-046",
  "speaker": "zhang_youshi",
  "text": "先生又问：“大奶奶从前的行经的日子问一问，断不是常缩，必是常长的。是不是？”",
  "title": "问行经日子",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "zhang_youshi",
    "kind": "idle",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c10-diagnose",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 10,
   "paragraphLead": "且说次日午间，人回道",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C10-047",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "那婆子答道：“可不是，从没有缩过，或是长两日三日，以至十日都长过。”先生听了道：“妙啊！这就是病源了。”",
  "title": "这就是病源",
  "actions": [],
  "offscreen": true
 },
